text = "Hello there, {person responsable's name of opening the safe} .
This book is like your sorta of a employee handbook, but without all the stupid rules maybe writen by a HR old grumpy lady . Yes .

So, the safe is locked (to protect safely the tasty money stored inside) . To be sure about the solidity of the security, a secret code of 100 characters have to be inputed .
To learn more about the secret code, just go to the next page .

As the official person that own this \"handbook\", it's YOUR role to keep it ONLY for you as MUCH as POSSIBLE .
The Direction don't want to see the Key of our security leeks out (and you don't want too) . It's OUR money !!!!!

[revision]
Since 2018, the French gouvernment has decided to \"punish us for our bad behavoir\", by freezing the money inside the safe . As if we are greddy !
So we hired Diego, to try to get back OUR money .
And now it's your role to find the secret code, to unlock the safe (they didn't do anything to stop that...)
You succed, or you die . Simple ennought ."
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3

