text = "Some retiries told the Direction about strange things hapening around them, like things spawning/disapearing in the room, or the book giving access to more and more pages .
Why ?
Because, I guess (I, as the writer of the handbook) .

And sometimes, it rewards you for unlocking pages with amazing rewards !
How nice it is :)

As a good employe, you have to embrace his Holy grace .
Maybe it will help you in your mission, who know ?"
